## O. Search

Three search modes working together:

### Text

- Keyword search — Search exact textual content such as "pricing".

### Semantic

- Semantic search — Understand meaning and intent, such as "modern SaaS pricing".

### Visual

- Screenshot search — Upload a screenshot to find visually similar sections.

- Combined filters — Combine text, semantic, and visual search with filters.

